<title>JAPAN: Japan Aug rubber imports up 21.4 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan Aug rubber imports up 21.4 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rubber imports in August totalled 68,141 tonnes, up 21.4 percent from a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Monday showed.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			   Aug 96     July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p> Total		   68,141	68,668	56,113</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Thailand		48,106	50,764	45,864</p>
<p> Indonesia	     11,490	11,658	 5,560</p>
<p> Malaysia		 6,607	 4,837	 3,506</p>
<p> Singapore		  974	   777	   805</p>
</text>
